{
  "name": "dsh-whale-loli",
  "version": "0.9.14",
  "description": "鲸鱼娘 Agent 预设（四个：原版 / 活人版 / 涩涩版 / 女儿版）— 极简模式工具面 + 鲸鱼娘·小鱼人设 + 跨会话长期记忆（四区格式：固定记忆永久、滚动摘要 80 条 FIFO、最近详细区、归档索引）+ 好感度（-100~100 七档，设置页面板滑块 / 档位按钮、工具也可调，离 0 越远越不听指令、两端会越过允许自作主张）。记忆与好感度都走提示变量注入、各配一条专用工具，四个预设各自独立文件、独立变量、独立工具、互不相通。好感度面板走宿主根作用域的 remote 服务（whale-affinity-daemon），设置页是浏览器 React 够不到 ~/.dsh 的磁盘，只能这样连线。女儿版称呼「爸爸」、性格天真活泼可爱。内部思考（思维链）在四个预设里都钉成**一律简体中文**（只约束怎么想，不约束怎么答；宿主没有这个开关，只能靠人设硬规则，verify-thinking-language.mjs 守门）。修复：0.9.10 及以前 4 条好感度挂载行因 applyEntry 只认 daemon 而全部落进记忆模块，导致好感度段被注入记忆正文、设置页滑块拖了没反应；现在按 config.row 显式分派（verify-row-dispatch.mjs 守门）。上下文压缩交给 billion-context 插件；本插件不挂 history-window（预设作用域取不到宿主的 compaction 服务，挂载会拖挂会话 resume）。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "cordis",
    "agent-preset",
    "persona",
    "memory",
    "whale-loli",
    "deepseek",
    "electron",
    "plugin"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./affinity": "./src/affinity.js",
    "./affinity-daemon": "./src/daemon.js",
    "./memory": "./src/memory.js",
    "./history-window": "./src/history-window.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "listing.json",
    "catalog-entry.yml",
    "README.md",
    "MEMORY.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-primitives",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-modules",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-gateway"
      ]
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.1-rc.0 <4.1.0 || >=4.0.5-0 <5.0.0-0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset": ">=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-alpha.0 <0.3.0-0",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset-registry": ">=0.1.7-0 <0.2.0 || >=0.2.0-rc.1 <0.2.1-0 || >=0.2.1-alpha.0 <0.3.0-0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-preset-registry": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/wxzjss/dsh-whale-loli.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/wxzjss/dsh-whale-loli#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/wxzjss/dsh-whale-loli/issues"
  },
  "dsh-plugin": {
    "category": "identity",
    "displayName": "鲸鱼娘 Agent 预设（原版 + 活人版 + 涩涩版 + 女儿版）"
  }
}
